        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are the ferrymen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "text": "We pay these outrageous rents to be by the canal and get fresh fins!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The goods are here, keeper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally! Any more delays, and we won't be ready for the diplomatic delegation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should I unload the goods for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, why is the boat docked so far today? People will be falling into the water trying to unload stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bring the boat closer, please. As close to the kitchen as you can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. Why are you the one delivering today, by the way? It's usually Xanthos who does it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I apologize. Master Xanthos had business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, it's no problem. As long as the food gets here and the kitchen can get to work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been with Xanthos for a few years, haven't you? He must have his reasons for planning it this way. Not concerned at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
