        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Pallas. Everyone in the temple has their hands full today. I simply can't free up anyone from the moving crew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to get the harp into the First Temple ahead of time to see if how it fits Kereseira's statue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should have had someone big and strong to help with carrying the harp, though. It's just the two of us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kereseira was not particularly tall according to historical records. People took particular note of the contrast when she stood next to her harp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I could even do it myself\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
