    {
        "text": "It's over... it's all over...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lamenting Male Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of a ferryman are you?! Full sails from five meters away? On a windy day like this? You knew your boat would go even faster than Hermes the Messenger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lamenting Male Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanted the boat as close to the kitchen as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Male Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lamenting Male Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't mean INSIDE the kitchen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lamenting Male Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Make way, make way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Peace officer's already dispersing onlookers. Don't crowd around like this. I need to see what happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lykeion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll uphold justice, won't you, Grammate\u00fas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just wanted the boat bringing the ingredients to be closer to the kitchen, but this kid rammed it right into the place!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry. I... don't know how to operate a boat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who do you think you're fooling? You've been studying with Xanthos at the crossing every day for years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theoretical knowledge does not equal practical skill.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why you\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can testify that this man never passed a single chariot racing test back in priest school.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't explain how he didn't see this huge stop sign, does it? The boat ran right through the fence!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't see...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Has Oripathy spread to his perceptual system? Is that why Lena made a home visit the other day?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lykeion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you look like you think I'm going to die soon\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, no! Don't say that! Even if it's true...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, Grammate\u00fas. I know the two of you used to be classmates, but you're here as an official, and my kitchen has suffered significant damage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is... your coin purse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll pay for the damage. Take what you need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's telling you to pay for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never got a proper job since you left priest school. I know Xanthos takes care of your room and board, but I doubt you have much money saved.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Spend your money on treatment. Don't forget you still owe me a debate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine, really... *cough* *cough*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The coughing... an acute attack? Doctor! I need a doctor over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just the smoke, you idiot! Go get someone to fight the fire, <i>Grammate\u00fas!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
