    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fire is getting stronger. Looks like the boat hit the kitchen stove... *cough* What's with all the smoke?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to get out, get away from the smoke. But the harp...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The harp's well-protected. I see the officers are already organizing people to fight the fire. It should be under control soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, the stairs are too narrow. The harp would get in the way of other people evacuating. Besides... *cough*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you alright, Pallas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. We need to leave. We can come back when the smoke's gone. Let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
