    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry. It's so crowded here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Pallas, did that guy look familiar to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear? That kid at the crossing was the one who rammed the boat into the kitchen. He usually looks pretty smart, but I guess he's as dumb as it gets when it comes to piloting a boat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gossiper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where was Xanthos? He's the one who usually delivers the goods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bored Listener"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too busy, maybe? But it's not like him to let an inexperienced apprentice get into trouble on his own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gossiper"
    },
    {
        "text": "True.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bored Listener"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I remember now. It was Xanthos, the ferryman, who ran into me just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Xanthos? Are you sure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "If he had the time to come to the hotel, why would he let an inexperienced apprentice steer the boat and cause an accident? Wait a second...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#15$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a bad feeling about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As do I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
